","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"In any case, keep 45 safe with Gr G11, they might break through our defense lines any time.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"UMP9","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"HK416","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"UMP9","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I will, but 416... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"You know that you no longer owe 45 anything, right?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"UMP9","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"HK416","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"416","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I know. She said so.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"UMP9","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"HK416","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"UMP9","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"So...is it time?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"UMP9","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"HK416","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"416","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"All I want is to prove myself.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But first of all, I must make sure you all survive.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"UMP9","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"HK416","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"UMP9","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Then... we are counting on you, we WILL save 45 here."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"G11","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"HK416","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Gr G11","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Are you alright over there, 416?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"G11","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"HK416","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"416","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The Commander is here, and we have a lot of T-Dolls.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Make sure you stay alive. We'll meet again.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"G11","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"HK416","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Gr G11","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Even though we don't know when, right? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I just hope...we'll get to fight together one last time."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"HK416","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"416","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Not this time. I can't carry you on my back anymore.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Transmission terminated."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"HK416","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"BG-RuinedCity","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"sfx","value":"Gunfight","raw":"SE2"},{"type":"bgm","value":"bossbattle_loop","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"416","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Not to mention, you won't be of much help here anyway. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Scheiße! How the hell can we penetrate their armor?! And what the hell are they?!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AK74U","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-74U","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Save your bullets, this is exactly what I meant. They have force fields designed especially to deflect our ammunition. It's practically impossible to get through them. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But thanks to you, we can at least organize a counterstrike behind the defense line."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"HK416","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"416","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You're very welcome."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Bang bang!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AK74U","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-74U","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"416, I just want to say that I'm very sorry about what I said. Also... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"You're pretty dependable...and a lot more capable than all the T-Dolls on the base now."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"HK416","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"416","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Just do your job; I only care about orders on the field."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AK74U","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"HK416","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-74U","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Now that you mention it, 416, you remember the Commander's order?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AK74U","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"HK416","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"416","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Draw the enemies' attention, slow them down, and don't let them find our extraction point."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AK74U","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"HK416","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-74U","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"That's right, if we can't do that, it's over. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"416, our mission is to buy time till the Commander's \"reinforcements\" get here, not to destroy the enemy, so I don't think we have to stand our ground here—"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AK74U","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"HK416","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"416","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"We still don't know when the so-called \"reinforcements\" will arrive so count on getting lucky. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Besides, we don't even know how much we can count on them."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AK74U","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"HK416","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-74U","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"In any case, we can't win on our own, right?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"HK416","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"416","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"One moment you wanna charge in blindly, the next you wanna retreat like a coward, what kind of T-doll are you?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Bang bang!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AK74U","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-74U","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"(Sighs) I was just making a suggestion, since you said so, I'll stay with you. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I just think we should trust the Commander. After all, you don't have a command module, and this place is not the most defendable..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"HK416","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"416","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The Commander is still busy mobilizing these \"reinforcements\". Once that's done, I'll hear from..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"HK416","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Click."}]}]},{"sprit